+# Request/revision accountability
+
+| Requirement | Outcome / location | Verification and remaining issue |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Pursue another available lead; avoid repeated completed searches | Two previously returned, unexamined official items downloaded; README1-2 and SOURCES | Actual HTTP 200 PDF bytes/pages/hashes verified; no repeated broad search or September part08 download |
+| Underlying records rather than another summary | Reported Excel 97 diskette/paper set and operator attachments identified, README1 | Reported original handover is not the native export or custody; TODOs retained |
+| Preserve conflicting records/source links | README2-3, FIELD-COMPARISON, OBSERVATION-PINS | Clock qualifiers, direct/collect accounts, differing name-system descriptions, citation dates and prior uncertainty preserved; no common-row/caller adjudication |
+| Test our assumptions and record contrary evidence | READING-CORRECTION and README2 | Preliminary1/1 claim was our misread; high-resolution0/1 retained; no false source discrepancy published as fact |
+| Distinguish actual scope | READING-SCOPE | Eight source page images plus one validation crop; 127-page locator extraction is not full reading/absence; older-source comparisons are reused prior work |
+| Missing inputs as TODO; maintain five tracks/all 18 | OPEN-TODOS | Original requirements remain open/partial; no outreach/new request/fee/privatecase or technical-owner duplication |
+| Preserve originals and earlier records | SOURCES and VERIFICATION | Source hash readback, exclusive additions; no prior report/source/history rewritten; no raw sources/personal/card/contact data in payload |
+| Commit and push reviewed findings as AveLyra | Separate exact publication manifest/receipts after review | Must independently verify account, author/committer, SSHdestination, remote ref and every file; this checklist itself is not push proof |
+| Actual text diff against preserved predecessor | TEXT-CHANGES.diff | New documents added against absent-path predecessor; full actual no-index diff. Existing shared reports/registers/workplan remain unchanged |
+| Periodic coordination | Separate local handoff status | Publication is not proof of delivery, reading, acceptance or integration by another chat |
+
+PDF image reading, mechanical provenance accounting, public Git verification and historical validation are separate outcomes. No independent expert review, native carrier decoding, clock calibration, experiment or full-production audit is claimed.
